# LeetCode Solutions in Python 

This repository contains my solutions to **LeetCode problems** implemented in **Python**.  
I am focusing on **clean code, optimal time complexity, and core problem-solving patterns** 
commonly asked in technical interviews.

---

## Problems Solved

### Arrays
- **Two Sum** (LC #1) — Hash Map
-**Two Sum 2**(LC #167) - Two Pointer
- **Remove Duplicates from Sorted Array**(LC #26) - Two pointer
- **Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock** (LC #121) - Sliding Window
- **Contains Duplicate** (LC #217) - Hash Set
- **Maximum Subarray** (LC #53) - Kadane’s Algorithm
- **Move Zeroes** (LC #283) - Two Pointers, In-Place
- **Maximum Average Subarray I**(LC #643) - Sliding Window(Fixed)
- **Product Of Array Except Self**(LC #238) - Prefix & Sufix Product(left-right product technique)
- **Defuse the Bomb**(LC #1652) - Sliding Window

### Strings
- **Valid Anagram** (LC #242) - Hash Map
- **Longest Substring Without Repeating** (LC #3) - Sliding Window,Hash table
- **Valid Palindrome** (LC #125) - Two Pointers
- **Group Anagrams** (LC #49)
- **Maximum Number of Vowels in a Substring of Given Length** (LC #1456) — Fixed-Size Sliding Window 

### Stacks
- **Valid Parentheses** (LC #20)
- **Min Stack** (LC #155)
- **Daily Temperatures** (LC #739)
- **Next Greater Element I** (LC #496)

---

## Patterns Covered
- Hash Tables
- Two Pointers
- Sliding Window
- In-Place Array Modification
- Kadane’s Algorithm
- Monotonic Stack

